          "source": ""
        }
      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A creature hit by the deathweb's web Strike is restrained and tethered to the spider, preventing it from moving farther away from the spider. The spider can have one creature tethered at a time. The DC to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape}or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.SjmKHgI7a5Z9JzBx]{Force Open}the web is 30. The tether can be severed with a Strike (AC 20, Hardness 5, HP 20), but this doesn&rsquo;t free the restrained creature.</p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "value": ""
        },
